# Changes in Niedersachsen ADT 23.11.2026
The ADT ("Abstrakte DatenTypen") classes of Niedersachsen are implemented in Folder @src\compiler\java\runtime\modules\niedersachsen
inside the online-ide.
The original classes in https://github.com/karlgerd/mk-nds-adt have been 
updated recently. Please 

  * 1. Report what signatures have been changed in the original classes and ask which of those should get changed in the online-ide
  * 2. Implement the changes.


